WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.680
On a dark, windy night, the long-bearded, red-faced hero set off into the darkness.

00:00:05.030 --> 00:00:09.542
He looked back once at the distant lights, thinking only of his sworn brother far away.

00:00:09.892 --> 00:00:12.724
The general traveled alone and arrived at a majestic pass.

00:00:13.074 --> 00:00:18.714
Tall walls blocked the way ahead, the gate shut tight, without a single sound.

00:00:19.064 --> 00:00:22.304
The soldiers at the pass blocked the road, and the general raised his great blade.

00:00:22.654 --> 00:00:27.022
His gaze was firm and he was not flustered at all as he slowly walked forward.

00:00:27.372 --> 00:00:30.204
The general pressed onward, and his fame spread far and wide.

00:00:30.554 --> 00:00:33.962
One pass followed another, and he never once stopped his steps.

00:00:34.312 --> 00:00:37.552
People by the roadside who heard his story could not help nodding in admiration.

00:00:37.902 --> 00:00:41.622
At last he was reunited with Liu Bei, and the two brothers embraced tightly.

00:00:41.972 --> 00:00:46.244
After being apart for so long, both men shed tears of joy.

00:00:46.594 --> 00:00:49.906
The general's loyalty and righteousness have moved countless people ever since.

00:00:50.256 --> 00:00:55.176
This story tells us that true friendship can withstand the hardest trials.

